                                "sense_id": "b44f5144-c4e3-3430-9861-368cf59b2676",
                                "text": "As already stated, the incubatory is constructed of sun-dried bricks, mortar and earth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c3d4c16-4008-44c2-8b65-4c9aa1b23014",
                                "sense_id": "b44f5144-c4e3-3430-9861-368cf59b2676",
                                "text": "Eggs are bought for the incubatory at never exceeding 5 cents per dozen, and chicks just from the shell are sold at less than 15 cents per dozen."
